# ForgeGuard Launch Standards

## Visual system
- Background: Deep Obsidian `#050505`
- Borders: `0.5px` — `border-[0.5px] border-white/[0.08]`
- Labels: `font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em]`
- Animations: Framer Motion via thin client wrappers only; pages stay Server Components by default

## Sovereign operator gate
- Only `SOVEREIGN_OPERATOR_EMAIL` (default `ksk805763@gmail.com`) may access `/admin` or Dev/Sovereign persona features
- Enforce server-side in `requireAdminProfile()`, layouts, and server actions — never trust client state

## Supabase security
- Enable RLS on every new public table
- Service-role-only tables (e.g. `attack_logs`): RLS on, no anon/authenticated policies
- UPDATE requires SELECT policy under RLS

## New routes checklist
- Register in `parallel-sovereignty.ts` and `ranks.ts` path guards
- Use live Supabase data; show `EmptyState` when zero rows, not placeholder TODOs
